<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ACC Corp restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ACC Corp restarted.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Wheat First Butcher Singer said it restarted coverage of ACC Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 2-3/8 at 34.</p>
